@Saket\_Om so this is another occurrence of the "*dangerous relocation: unsupported relocation*" issue which seems to have appeared with GCC 14 in CubeIDE v2.1.0.

@Mahmoud Ben Romdhane raised internal ticket Number: **228023** on it [here](https://community.st.com/t5/stm32cubeide-mcus/system-stm32wb0x-c-dangerous-relocation-unsupported-relocation/m-p/882621/highlight/true#M41119).

See also:

*[CubeIDE 2.1.0: system\_stm32wl3x.o dangerous relocation: unsupported relocation](https://community.st.com/t5/stm32cubeide-mcus/cubeide-2-1-0-system-stm32wl3x-o-dangerous-relocation/m-p/883226)*

